              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "a defpackage with no (:documentation \"…\") option and no comment describing the package"
              }
            },
            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "An unattributed marker is a note to nobody: no owner to ask, no ticket to schedule, and no date to judge its age by. Finding out costs a `git blame`. One more token answers all three questions."
